Cross-shelf administration WRITES live here (spec 3b-i, D0).

This directory is sanctioned by two architecture fences in
tests/Feature/Architecture/WideningArchitectureTest.php: it is the only
place outside app/Queries/Admin/ that may call TenantContext::systemWide(),
and the only place at all that may call AuditRecorder::global() or
::forShelf(). Task 1 creates it empty; Tasks 4-7 fill it.

Under a widening the bookshelf scope stops narrowing and the creating hook
stops stamping, so every Action here reaches shelf-scoped rows through
relations from the Bookshelf ($shelf->memberships(), $shelf->contacts()),
never through a hand-written bookshelf_id predicate.

Delete this file once the directory holds real code.
